          "items": [
            "Stay More, Save More!<br>•\t10% off a 7-night stay when you book directly on our website using coupon code 7nt10.<br>•\tOffer applies to new reservations only. Other restrictions may apply.<br><br>About the Cottage<br>Welcome to your newly decorated lakefront vacation cottage in the charming Laurel Grove community, part of the only five-star resort on the Emerald Coast. This beautifully appointed three-bedroom, three-bath home features trendy coastal furnishings, inviting you to relax and unwind. With 2,190 square feet of space, everyone will feel right at home.<br>•\tDirect lake and golf course views<br>•\tFour passenger golf cart included with option to upgrade to the six person cart or upgrade and have both—reach the beach in just 10–12 minutes<br>•\tEasy access to Grand Boulevard for shopping, fine dining, movies, and groceries<br><br>Resort Amenities<br>•\tLaurel Grove clubhouse with seasonally heated pool, hot tub, exercise room and outdoor grills (short walk from the cottage)<br>•\tPonds for catch-and-release fishing<br>•\tVillage at Baytowne Wharf for family activities and vibrant nightlife<br>•\tFour world-class golf courses, private beach, tennis courts, walking and bike trails<br>•\tGrand Boulevard Mall with grocery, clothing, and dining options<br>•\tHeated neighborhood pool during winter holidays and year-round access to the Phil Hummel SOA pool<br><br>Inside the Cottage<br>•\tSunny family room with travertine floors, sleeper sofa, Smart TV, and high-speed WiFi<br>•\tGourmet kitchen: granite countertops, GE Profile stainless steel appliances, and an outdoor grill for family dinners<br>•\tPeaceful back porch overlooking the lake and golf course<br><br>Accommodation Details<br>Downstairs<br>•\tKing master bedroom with its own ensuite bathroom.<br>•\tKing guest bedroom with direct access to the hall bathroom.<br>•\tLiving room with a sofa sleeper for additional sleeping space.<br>Upstairs<br>•\tQueen and twin bedroom with a twin trundle bed, along with a private bathroom.<br>Comfort Features<br>Upstairs is equipped with a split A/C unit, ensuring the entire house stays cool even during the summer months.<br><br>The Golf Cart Advantage<br>Explore the resort with ease using your complimentary four-person and optional six-person golf carts. Drive through the resort's lighted tunnel for hassle-free access to the beach, Grand Boulevard, and Baytowne Wharf—no need for a car!<br>Note: Golf carts may vary from those pictured.<br><br>The Emerald Coast Experience<br>Discover why Frommer's named the Florida Panhandle one of the world's most beautiful places. With over 300 sunny days a year, pristine white sand beaches, and emerald green waters, this is the ultimate destination for relaxation and adventure. Enjoy an upscale yet casual atmosphere perfect for families and couples alike.<br>Complimentary Activities<br><br>Free activities included in your stay! Your stay includes over $700 of FREE activities every day of your stay. With the Memories Fun Pass, all eligible reservations receive one free ticket, every day of your stay, to the following attractions:<br><br>Sea Blaster Daytime and Sunset Dolphin Cruises<br>Day Passes to Big Kahuna's Water Park<br>Party Fishing Trips<br>Golf at Regatta Bay<br>Golf at Emerald Bay<br>Golf at Windswept Dunes<br>Golf Simulation Studio<br>Baytowne Adventure Zone<br>Indoor Black Light Mini Golf<br>Bike Rentals<br><br>Ready for the Perfect Vacation?<br>Reserve your lakefront cottage now to take advantage of the FREE golf cart offer and exclusive discounts. Make unforgettable memories on the Emerald Coast—where charm, beauty, and endless activities await!",
