          }
        ],
        "text": "First of all - Do something about the cold weather and especially the 5 inches of snow that hung around for days. Secondly, the TV setup was poor. We had to get someone in there to help. Was never able to stream programs. Thirdly, we did not expect to have to dispose of roaches. One a day for 4 days. We maybe are not good ones for a review. We left Florida a week early mainly due to the cold weather and snow. Sorry, but we would not rent this house again.",
